==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*20 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Dolphina]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[Kid Tappa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
*2 [[Dolphina]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam medium-ranged units (e.g. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]]) for an easy win. Do not use meatshields. Long-range fast attackers such as [[Saber (Uber Rare Cat)|Saber]] work well too. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is very helpful against the base's [[Wave Attack]], as well as [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine Mk 3]], due to its Wave Shield ability, low range and resistance to Nyandam's attacks.

[[Kid Tappa]]'s [[Barrier]] can easily be exploited to stack units like [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Grandmaster Cat]], [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]]. Dark Lazer can create mass [[Wave Attack]]s and is [[Strong Against|strong]] against Red, so she works well against everything. Golfer can 'outrange' Nyandam with his [[Long Distance]] attacks. Just spam [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]] to protect them from the Wall Doges. Golfer and Dark Lazer have low range, so they can sneak into Dolphina's blindspot. Don't forget to bring the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]] for when Nyandam and all the Dolphinas are dead.

==Trivia==
*The [[wikipedia:Escolar|escolar]] is a species of predatory fish named after the Spanish word for scholar, ''escolar'', because the rings around its eyes resemble spectacles.

